  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: at bridge over R. Ofanto. This place is not to be confused with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../432709\" target=\"_self\" title=\"Aufidena\">Aufidena (Alfedena)</a>.</p>",
